              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 4:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mumoyo wangu ndakali kuyandaula kubotezya-botezya mubili wangu awaini, nekuba kuti ndakali kulyeendelezya cabusongo, akujata bufubafuba, mane nkabone na ncinzi cintu cibotela bantu, ncibeelede kucita ansi ano, mumazuba mace aabuumi bwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.23+1KI.10.24+1KI.10.25+1KI.10.26+1KI.10.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bam 10:23-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.22+2CH.9.23+2CH.9.24+2CH.9.25+2CH.9.26+2CH.9.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mak 9:22-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakacita milimo mipati. Ndakaliyakila maanda akulibyalila myuunda yamasaansa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakalicitila myuunda amakwa, akubyala mumonya omo misyobo yoonse yamisamu yamicelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakalicitila maziba aamaanzi aakutilaila misamu njendakabyala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bam 4:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakavuba bazike baalumi abanakazi, alimwi ndakalijisi bazike ibakazyalwa muŋanda yangu. Alimwi ridakavuba iŋombe ambelele zinji loko kwiinda boonse ibakanditaangunina mu-Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bam 10:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.14+1KI.10.15+1KI.10.16+1KI.10.17+1KI.10.18+1KI.10.19+1KI.10.20+1KI.10.21+1KI.10.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.9.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi ndakalijanina insiliva angolida azintu ziyandika zyabami azyazisi zimbi. Ndakavuba basikwiimba, baalumi abanakazi, azintu zibotezya bantu, nkokuti ziimbyo zinji zyamisyobo misyobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.29.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Mak 29:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Muk 1:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo ndakali kuya bukomena kwiinda boonse ibakanditaangunina mu-Jerusalemu, abwalo busongo bwangu bwakaciliwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Muk 3:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumbwa cintu meso aangu ncaakali kuyanda, teendakali kwaakasya pe. Teendakakasya moyo wangu kucita neciba comwe cibotezya, nkaambo moyo wangu wakali kukondwa kumilimo yangu yoonse, Mbubulumbu mbundakajana kumilimo yangu yoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele nindakayeeya milimo yoonse yamaanza aangu, amakataalo oonse aakwiicita, ndakabona kuti zintu zyoonse nzyabuyo. Tazigwasyi pe, taakwe impindu zijanika ansi ano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
