          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.1.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Muk 1:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpoonya awo ndakatalika kuyeeya makani aabusongo abufubafuba abusondosi mbwaabede. Muntu uulya izina lyamwami acitenzi? Taakwe cintu ncaakonzya kucita pele ezyo zyakacitwa kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ndakabona kuti busongo bulainda bufubafuba, mbubonya mbuli mumuni mbuuinda mudima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.8.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Muk 8:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.9.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musongo uli ameso mumutwe wakwe, anukuti mufubafuba uleenda mumudima, nekubaboobo ndizi kuti cintu comwe cilabasikila boonse, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ndakaamba mumoyo wangu kuti, Cintu eco nciconya cisikila mufubafuba cilandisikila ambebo. Ino cilandigwasya buti kuba abusongo bunji? Ndakaamba mumoyo wangu kuti, Eci acalo ncabuyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo musongo tayeeyegwi lyoonse, mbubonya mbuli mufubafuba. Mumazuba aaboola boonse buyo banooyoolubidwe, Ma! Musongo ulafwa mbubonya mbuli mufubafuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo ndakasula buumi, nkaambo milimo yoonse iicitwa ansi yakandikataazya. Zyoonse nzyabuyo, tazikutyi moyo pe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
