                  "text": "14:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mazuba aakwe oonse alizwide mapenzi, amilimo yakwe ilakataazya. Akuciindi camasiku moyo wakwe tuukede cakuliiba. Eci acalo ncabuyo.",
          "type": "text",
